X:30
T:Nancy Dawson's Hornpipe
A:Lancashire - Wyresdale
B:A John Winder Book, April 1789
L:1/8
N:mss a bit confused. looks as though he started to write in in 6/8 (which
N:is actually written, but crossed out) and then changed his mind halfway
N:through and altered things. And then somebody else seems to have pencilled in their ideas. The overall impression is more 2/4 than 6/8.
O:England
Z:Richard Robinson <URL:http://www.qualmograph.org.uk/contact.html>
